//! AC description: Language detection covers at least: Rust (.rs), Python (.py), TypeScript (.ts/.tsx), JavaScript (.js/.jsx), Markdown (.md), JSON (.json), TOML (.toml), Shell (.sh/.bash/.zsh), YAML (.yml/.yaml), HTML (.html), CSS (.css), Go (.go), C (.c/.h), C++ (.cpp/.hpp), Java (.java). Files without a known extension get `"language": "unknown"`.
